## R7 proof, check 4: shadow.rib with the small blocking sphere removed --
## the shadowed pixel must read brighter once nothing stands between the
## receiver and the light. Not third-party.
Display "shadow_noblocker.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 320 240 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.1]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [1.0] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
	"from" [5 2 -3] "to" [0 0 0]
Sides 1
Surface "matte" "Ka" [0.2] "Kd" [0.8]

AttributeBegin
	Translate 0 0 7
	Sphere 3 -3 3 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
